			I don't think Master will see play in modern. He's too slow, and not a lord.  If he produced merfolk, then yes, he'd see play. As it is, not so much. <br />
<br />
I am excited for his possibilities in standard.  I could totally see a U/r Tempo/Midrange Merfolk deck forming. Red splash could be for <a class="autocardhref" href="http://www.magiccards.info/query?q=%21Dynacharge" onclick="AutoCard('Dynacharge'); return false;" title="Dynacharge">Dynacharge</a> (incredible with master), <a class="autocardhref" href="http://www.magiccards.info/query?q=%21Magma+Jet" onclick="AutoCard('Magma Jet'); return false;" title="Magma Jet">Magma Jet</a>, or maybe <a class="autocardhref" href="http://www.magiccards.info/query?q=%21Young+Pyromancer" onclick="AutoCard('Young Pyromancer'); return false;" title="Young Pyromancer">Young Pyromancer</a>.
		</div>
