		<!-- message -->
		<div id="post_message_10660171">
			
			Master of the Waves seems totally awesome. Those tokens will trigger all sorts of 'enter the battlefield' shenanigans, so right there you could create insane value with a single Beck having been cast, or deal some massive damage if you have Purphoros out. Of course, just making dudes and beating face works too.<br />
<br />
Nighthowler has rad art and might be one of the more playable Bestow critters we've seen so far. Right now, ya, there's Scavenging Ooze to deal with, but it won't be in Standard forever.<br />
<br />
Pyxis of Pandemonium is one of the cooler casual cards they've printed so far. Someone is going to do very evil things with it. You can just tell.
		</div>
		<!-- / message -->

		

		
		

		
		<!-- sig -->
			<div>
				__________________<br />
				<b>Deadmau5 on MTGO.</b><br />
