				</div>
				<div style="font-style:italic">Because <a class="autocardhref" href="http://www.magiccards.info/query?q=%21Voice+of+Resurgence" onclick="AutoCard('Voice of Resurgence'); return false;" title="Voice of Resurgence">Voice of Resurgence</a> needed to jump to $100 apiece... <img src="http://forums.mtgsalvation.com/images/smilies/icon9.gif" border="0" alt="" title="Frown" class="inlineimg" /></div>
			
		</td>
	</tr>
	</table>
</div>Or you people could stop playing that card. It really isn't that freaking great. I have NEVER had an issue with it, and that's including the game I chose to doom blade my opponents entire play set on their turn. It's not a good card in standard, and I would go so far as to say it's subpar, but everyone keeps throwing them at me, so clearly somewhere along the line people got the idea in their head that it's good because it's a 50 dollar card.<br />
<br />
I'm pretty sure that there's not really much that the black card does for voice though. Even in junk sac, which is already losing a pretty hefty chunk of it's core, voice isn't going to gain much out of the aura effect.
